{"v":4,"catch":"每次用一隻UFO來擊退Zeroptian入侵","desc":"從過去的舊式街機射擊遊戲中汲取靈感，並添加了一些現代風格和令人驚嘆的像素美術，Zeroptian Invasion可說是往昔街機射擊遊戲的現代版。\n\n從逐步提昇的遊戲難度，到採用晶片音樂的遊戲配樂，這款懷舊之作絕對不容射擊遊戲迷錯過，畢竟危險的Zeroptian可不會在短期內自我毀滅。\n\n特色：\n\n• 具有挑戰性的經典遊戲。\n• 彩色1位元的像素藝術。\n• 困難又經典的遊玩方式。\n• 敵人種類超多，老大令人難忘。","publisher":"eastasiasoft","release":"2020-03-05","genres":["射擊","街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","俄文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89f9c6c00b2ca276d8e97bcb04375509b80f43b4001d840737d6eeb154e0ebab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7a1e2def5760b254c2d1a542b7690f898de533f08e2836b889682e5293637bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/817f474180eea817c4205697d9b4b28f566d556871777a41bc906e1cf03aae36.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46c197a321c30f40b580bf42012c8de5cdd6a79220e9ed28d67d5a9fa1e2f2bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec0298bbd912cec0148d45063b1ad7773368b6efd02bd07981961603294a0961.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ba9fabe778700d8ef0b74e956369bd429d0d4e2c4269694e73deea73cf2251c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c6200d968000","dlc":[]}